<title>USA: CME March S&amp;P 500 futures rally initial 7-pt limit.</title>
<headline>CME March S&amp;P 500 futures rally initial 7-pt limit.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>March Standard and Poor's 500 futures rallied the initial seven-point trading limit in early trade to hit 789.65, then trade paused for two minutes.</p>
<p>After trading resumed, March extended its gains to 790.25. There is now a 15-point limit to price declines, but no further upside limits.</p>
<p>--Chicago Derivatoves Desk (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com</p>
